{"id":"letztendlich","lemma":"letztendlich","pos":"adv","rank":2757,"glosses":["eventually, finally, ultimately, at last"],"ipa":"/lɛtstˈʔɛntlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/De-letztendlich.ogg/De-letztendlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe letztendlich aufgegeben.","en":"I finally gave up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391389","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"abandoned"}]},{"text":"Ich gab es letztendlich auf.","en":"I finally gave up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"on"}]},{"text":"Letztendlich wird Tom mir alles erzählen.","en":"Tom will tell me everything eventually.","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"to tell"}]},{"text":"Tom hat letztendlich eine gute Arbeit gefunden.","en":"Tom has finally found a good job.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"found, located"}]},{"text":"Es ist letztendlich alles eine Frage des Geldes.","en":"It all comes down to a question of money.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"everything"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"money","l":"Geld"}]}]}